      "writtenOn": "2022-11-21T18:24:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was going to blame the author of the file, but it was me. I must of copy-pasted it from somewhere.\n\nThe rules for zephyr header order are:\n\n1) \"\" includes\n2) Special \u003c\u003e includes: (assert|complex|ctype|errno|fenv|float|inttypes|limits|locale|math|setjmp|signal|stdarg|stdbool|stddef|stdint|stdio|stdlib|string|tgmath|time|wchar|wctype)\\.h\n3) \u003czephyr/*\u003e includes\n4) Everything else.",
      "parentUuid": "4f448ccd_deb873c8",
      "revId": "386026a7d393946e7c6e9a566d3f8ca7f4353427",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
