        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-21T18:52:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I take \"special\" to mean headers from the C standard library. I can\u0027t think of any other headers that would be on the system include path besides `\u003czephyr/...\u003e` ones. What would be in \"everything else\"?",
      "parentUuid": "8f2726fe_baeb0775",
      "revId": "386026a7d393946e7c6e9a566d3f8ca7f4353427",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
