        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-11-21T19:01:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct. I don\u0027t think there should be system includes that aren\u0027t either of those in our codebase. The only other source of includes I can think of would be if we depended on a third-party Zephyr module in our build. I don\u0027t know how the Zephyr build handles those include paths, but I could see them being on the system include path.",
